    Leaflet → MapKit (Map{}, MapPolyline.stroke, Annotation, MapCameraPosition; FitBounds → TSMapCamera).
    Speed-band hex → semantic design tokens (exact dark-mode match): #10b981=Color.TS.statusSuccess,
      #00f0ff=Color.TS.accent, #f59e0b=Color.TS.statusWarning, #ef4444=Color.TS.statusDanger.
    Shared components: TSFadeIn / TSGlassPanel / TSButton / TSSkeleton / TSMapStyle / TSMapCamera /
